<h1>Finish filling in <%= @title %></h1>
<p>You saved <strong><%= @title %></strong> on <%= site_name %> to finish later. Open this link to carry on where you left off.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Finish the form", @link, class: "button" %></p>
<p class="note">
  The link works until <%= l(@expires_at, format: :long) %>. Files you attached aren't kept, so attach them again before
  you send the form. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email and what was saved is deleted when the link expires.
</p>
